<%- include('partials/header') %>

<section class="page-intro">
  <p class="eyebrow">FROM OUR PANTRY TO YOURS</p>
  <h1>A few good questions.</h1>
  <p>A little help before your next spoonful.</p>
</section>

<section class="faq-list">
  <% [
    [
      'Are you nut butters homemade?',
      'Yes! Our nut butters are handcrafted in small batches right here in Mesa, Arizona. Stonebridge Nut Butters operates under the Arizona Cottage Food Program, allowing us to prepare our products in a home kitchen.
      <br><br>
      We take pride in creating fresh, delicious nut butters with thoughtfully selected ingredients.'
    ],
    [
      'What ingredients do you use?',
      'We start every nut butter blend with roasted peanuts and <strong>no added oils</strong>.
      <br><br>
      Our flavored varieties feature a delicious combination of nuts, seeds, sweeteners, and other flavorful ingredients to create their unique taste.
      <br><br>
      For a complete list of ingredients, please visit each product's individual listing.'
    ],
    [
      'Do your products contain allergens?',
      'Our peanut butter products contain <strong>peanuts</strong>, a major food allergen.
      <br><br>
      Additional allergens may be present depending on the ingredients used in each flavor. Please review the ingredient and allergen information on each product's label before consuming.
      <br><br>
      If you have a food allergy or dietary concern, please contact us before purchasing.'
    ],
    [
      'How should I store my nut butter?',
      'Our nut butters are made fresh and can be stored in a cool, dry place.
      <br><br>
      Natural oil separation may occur over time—this is completely normal! Simply give your nut butter a good stir to restore its smooth, creamy consistency.
      <br><br>
      Refrigeration can help minimize oil separation but will also result in a firmer texture. For the best freshness and flavor, we recommend enjoying your nut butter within 2 months of production.'
    ],
    [
      'Why is their oil on top of my nut butter?',
      'A little oil separation is perfectly natural! Because we don't add stabilizing oils to our nut butter base, the peanuts' natural oils may rise to the surface over time.
      <br><br>
      Simply give your nut butter a good stir to bring back that delicious, creamy consistency. It's all part of the natural nut butter experience!'
    ]
      
    [
      'Where do you ship?',
      'Stonebridge Nut Butters operates under Arizona's Cottage Food Program, so we're currently able to ship only within Arizona.
      <br><br>
      We offer a flat shipping rate of <strong>$7.95 per order</strong> anywhere in the state.
      <br><br>
      Prefer to skip shipping? <strong>Free local pickup is available in Mesa, Arizona!</strong>'
    ],
    [
      'How does local pickup work?',
      'We offer free local pickup in Mesa, Arizona!
      <br><br>
      Simply select the pickup option during checkout, and we'll provide instructions for collecting your order once it's ready.
      <br><br>
      Please wait for your pickup confirmation before heading our way!'
    ],
    [
      'Do you accept returns or exchanges?',
      'Because our nut butters are food products, we're unable to accept returns or exchanges.
      <br><br>
      However, your satisfaction matters to us! If your order arrives damaged or something isn't quite right, please contact us so we can help make it right.'
    ]
    [
      'Will my basket be saved?',
      'Your shopping basket is automatically saved in your browser, so you can come back later and pick up right where you left off!
      <br><br>
      Just keep in mind that clearing your browser data may remove your saved basket, and your basket won't transfer between devices.'
    ]
  ].forEach(([question, answer]) => { %>
    <details>
      <summary><%= question %></summary>
      <p><%= answer %></p>
    </details>
  <% }) %>
</section>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>
